<p>"Roofing Contractor" performed best for "roofing company near me" (average position 4.2). "Roof Repair" performed best for "roof leak repair" (average position 3.1) but poorly for "new roof" (average position 9.7). "Metal Roofing Contractor" dominated "metal roof installation" (average position 2.4) but was invisible for generic roofing searches.</p>

