<p>If you are in HVAC, add these dates to your calendar:</p>

<ul>
<li><strong>March 1:</strong> Switch primary to "HVAC Contractor" (spring maintenance season)</li>
<li><strong>June 1:</strong> Switch primary to "Air Conditioning Repair Service" (summer peak)</li>
<li><strong>September 1:</strong> Switch primary to "HVAC Contractor" (fall maintenance)</li>
